---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Malejemplo handles data collected on this site.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="fine-print">
        Draft starting point, not legal advice — have this reviewed before the site goes live with a
        real domain (see GATE24_Web_Brief_v2.md section 8).
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        If you accept cookies via the banner, we use Google Analytics to understand traffic to this
        site (pages visited, approximate location, device type). No analytics run before you accept.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you submit the newsletter or contact form, we collect the email address and message you
        provide, to reply to you or to notify you about new products. We don't sell or share this
        data with third parties beyond the form/email providers used to operate the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Downloads</h2>
      <p>
        GATE.24 downloads are handled by a third-party platform (Gumroad), not this site directly.
        That platform has its own privacy policy governing the download/payment process.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can decline analytics cookies at any time from the cookie banner, and can request your
        contact/newsletter data be deleted by reaching out via the <a href="/about#contact">contact form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .fine-print {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-left: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
